    slug: 'trigger-based-snow-dispatch-software',
    title: 'Trigger Based Dispatch in Snow Removal Software',
    description: 'Trigger Based Dispatch in Snow Removal Software. Learn how this snow removal software feature helps plow business owners run a more profitable, organized winter operation.',
