    slug: 'snow-removal-route-tracking-software',
    title: 'Live Route Tracking in Snow Removal Software',
    description: 'Live Route Tracking in Snow Removal Software. Learn how this snow removal software feature helps plow business owners run a more profitable, organized winter operation.',
