    slug: 'snow-removal-software-vs-spreadsheets',
    title: 'Snow Removal Software Versus Spreadsheets',
    description: 'Snow Removal Software Versus Spreadsheets. Learn how this snow removal software feature helps plow business owners run a more profitable, organized winter operation.',
    date: '2025-06-30',
